Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(ci):=20CI=20=E4=B8=8A=E8=B7=B3=E8=BF=87?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=98=BF=E9=87=8C=E4=BA=91=20Maven=20=E9=95=9C=E5=83=8F?=
